abstract: "A runnable Task 2 lab for unregistered 3D developmental point clouds. It combines rigid-motion-invariant descriptors, fused expression-geometry transport, proper-rotation alignment, normalized shape interpolation, physical-scale forecasting and chirality-aware signatures, with synthetic examples and tests."
